# Docs stay current

Docs are part of the change. Do not finish a turn that leaves `docs/` or agent files lying.

| If you changed | Update |
| --- | --- |
| Scope, status machine, streams, Paymob contract | `docs/plan.md` |
| Trust, schema, HTTP, code map | `docs/Architecture.md` |
| Anything user- or agent-visible | `docs/changelog.md` (Unreleased) |
| Setup, env, how to run | `README.md` |
| Agent instructions | `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `cursor.md`, `grok.md` together |
| Hard product rules | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` |

Minimum: a changelog line. If the contract moved, the spec and architecture too. Do not add routes or tables that exist only in code.
